  "description": "Cowboy Block – Bold Western Display Font\nCowboy Block is a bold Western display font with strong block serifs and a clean vintage cowboy style.\nThis all-caps Cowboy Block typeface is characterized by robust, thick letterforms and distinctive decorative spurs (or wedges) extending from the serifs, providing a genuine saloon-style feel that is highly impactful and masculine. Its strong, condensed weight ensures maximum visibility in signage and headers.\nUse this authentic Western font for designing old-timey wanted posters, custom saloon or barbecue restaurant signage, apparel branding for outdoor and rustic goods, or creating bold titles for country music album art. The Cowboy Block font is the essential typeface for capturing the spirit of the frontier.\nIts rugged shapes and classic Wild-West look make it ideal for standout titles, rustic logos, printed apparel, badges, labels, posters, and retro-themed projects.\nPerfect for designers who want a powerful, authentic Western aesthetic in their work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Cowboy Block – Bold Western Display Font</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Cowboy Block is a bold Western display font with strong block serifs and a clean vintage cowboy style.</strong></p>\n<p>This all-caps <strong>Cowboy Block typeface</strong> is characterized by robust, thick letterforms and distinctive decorative spurs (or wedges) extending from the serifs, providing a genuine saloon-style feel that is highly impactful and masculine. Its strong, condensed weight ensures maximum visibility in signage and headers.</p>\n<p>Use this authentic <strong>Western font</strong> for designing <strong>old-timey wanted posters</strong>, custom saloon or <strong>barbecue restaurant signage</strong>, apparel branding for outdoor and rustic goods, or creating <strong>bold titles for country music album art</strong>. The <strong>Cowboy Block font</strong> is the essential typeface for capturing the spirit of the frontier.</p>\n<p>Its rugged shapes and <strong>classic Wild-West look </strong>make it ideal for standout titles, rustic logos, printed apparel, badges, labels, posters, and retro-themed projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Perfect for designers who want a powerful, authentic Western aesthetic in their work.</strong></p>",
